# 7. FORMULA AST

Build a Formula Abstract Syntax Tree.

Convert:

```excel
=IFERROR(A1+B1*C1,0)
```

into a tree conceptually:

```text
IFERROR
│
├── ADDITION
│   │
│   ├── A1
│   │
│   └── MULTIPLICATION
│       ├── B1
│       └── C1
│
└── 0
```

Each AST node should contain:

```python
{
    "node_id": "...",
    "function": "IFERROR",
    "formula_fragment": "...",
    "arguments": [],
    "source_cell": "...",
    "result": ...,
    "status": "...",
    "children": []
}
```

